      "versionNonce": 1476060551,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731970195740,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.JS and nodejs \n2.Express and mongoDb\n3.Mongoose and ejs \n4.React -In progress(Net Ninja/Angela Yu/Crash Course)\n->Net ninja:19 Anglea yu:20)\n->EJS full stack(21 sprint)\n->Mern sprint(22)\n->Authentication(23rd to 24th)\n5.MERN stack(Acdemind/Stephen)\n->(25th to 28th acdemind/ than :28th to 2nd)\n\n6.Postgres and Prisma (3rd to 5th)\n\n7.Create a Postgres+Primsa+Express+EJS website\n(6th)\n8.Create 2 Pern webApp(7th)\n\n9.HUGE Mern project(8th to 18th)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.JS and nodejs \n2.Express and mongoDb\n3.Mongoose and ejs \n4.React -In progress(Net Ninja/Angela Yu/Crash Course)\n->Net ninja:19 Anglea yu:20)\n->EJS full stack(21 sprint)\n->Mern sprint(22)\n->Authentication(23rd to 24th)\n5.MERN stack(Acdemind/Stephen)\n->(25th to 28th acdemind/ than :28th to 2nd)\n\n6.Postgres and Prisma (3rd to 5th)\n\n7.Create a Postgres+Primsa+Express+EJS website\n(6th)\n8.Create 2 Pern webApp(7th)\n\n9.HUGE Mern project(8th to 18th)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
